1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,533
I built a little app for sending
screencasts to my agents.

2
00:00:03,533 --> 00:00:05,433
It’s called ScreenContext.

3
00:00:05,433 --> 00:00:07,533
Just start it from your agent

4
00:00:07,533 --> 00:00:08,867
and record the changes.

5
00:00:08,867 --> 00:00:11,137
This heading should be shorter.

6
00:00:11,137 --> 00:00:13,767
And this button here
is very hard to see.

7
00:00:13,767 --> 00:00:14,067
Stop recording.

8
00:00:14,067 --> 00:00:15,500
Click Copy & Return.

9
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:15,950
Click Copy & Return.

10
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:16,800
Paste it into your agent,

11
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:17,450
Paste it into your agent,

12
00:00:17,450 --> 00:00:19,167
and tell it what to do.

13
00:00:19,167 --> 00:00:21,800
Make the changes
that are described.

14
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,100
Here’s the result:

15
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,250
a shorter heading

16
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:27,200
and a button that stands out.

17
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:28,850
That’s ScreenContext.

18
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:30,233
Now on the App Store.
